  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN233.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">piriviṉkaṇ vēṟupaṭṭa talaimakaṭkut tōḻi colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante said to HER who had undergone changes during the separation.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN233.1">
        <l>alamaraṉ maḻaikkaṇ malkupaṉi vāraniṉ</l>
        <l>ṉalarmulai naṉaiya vaḻāaṟ ṟōḻi</l>
        <l>yerikavar puṇṭa karipuṟap perunilam</l>
        <l>pīṭupaṭu maruṅki ṉōṭumaḻai tuṟanteṉa</l>
        <l>vūṉil yāṉai yuyaṅkum vēṉiṉ</l>
        <l>maṟappaṭaik ku<supplied>ti</supplied>rai māṟā main<supplied>ti</supplied>ṟ</l>
        <l>ṟuṟakka meytiya toyyā nallicai</l>
        <l>mutiyarp pēṇiya vutiyañ cēral</l>
        <l>peruñcōṟu koṭutta ñāṉṟai yirumpakal</l>
        <l>kūḷi cuṟṟaṅ kūṟiyirun tāṅku</l>
        <l>kuṟiyavu neṭiyavuṅ kuṉṟutalai maṇanta</l>
        <l>curaṉiṟan takaṉṟaṉa rāyiṉu mikanaṉi</l>
        <l>maṭaṅkā vuḷḷamoṭu matimayak kuṟāap</l>
        <l>poruḷvayi ṉīṭalō vilarniṉ</l>
        <l><supplied>ṉi</supplied>ruḷaiṅ kūnta liṉṟuyiṉ maṟantē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">While tears swell in [your] perturbed rain eyes</l>
        <l corresp="2">so that your blooming breasts become wet, don’t cry, friend.</l>
        <l corresp="5">In summer, when the foodless elephant languishes</l>
        <l>because the running rains abandoned the places where the vast ground </l>
        <l corresp="3f">with charred outside turned to waste, seized [and] consumed by flames,</l>
        <l corresp="12a-c">even though he departed traversing the desert,</l>
        <l corresp="11">where hills short and long join [their] heads</l>
        <l corresp="10">like the retinue of demons that sat in talk</l>
        <l corresp="9">on the great day when great rice was given</l>
        <l corresp="8">by Utiyañcēral who honoured the ancients</l>
        <l corresp="7">of imperishable fame who reached heaven</l>
        <l corresp="6">in unbroken pride, on horseback with a valorous army,</l>
        <l corresp="12d-13">with a heart very much untamed, [his] mind not in confusion,</l>
        <l corresp="14">delaying for the sake of wealth? Not he,</l>
        <l corresp="15">forgetting the sweet sleep on your dark tresses [done up in] five [shocks]?</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

